12e6" label="ambiguous">J. LECOUVET, Vic. Gen.</l><l xml:id="m-7aa66695-0fb6-4fd8-a30d-8392a80ae63c" facs="#m-8fd54644-6334-4c2c-843f-5de9af529eb0" label="ambiguous">In universam nostram excogitandi scribendique rhythmi rationem</l><l xml:id="m-fd278b65-1a3d-45b7-8d7d-f3cffcb443c4" facs="#m-4c84b7c2-5d44-4d88-951e-568d3fbf0089" label="ambiguous">omnia jura vindicabimu¬</l><l xml:id="m-96da7c42-d1b6-4c0a-8408-964af2dd0ba3" facs="#m-f0be5b25-5f63-400b-b9e0-9b8ecfd0051b" label="lyrics-like">DESCLÉE ET SOCH, Tornaci (Belg.).</l><l xml:id="m-26b71411-36d3-4efc-93ed-c73c48d6b474" facs="#m-5d0e49fb-351c-437b-8a34-6f0378b89505" label="lyrics-like">Imprimé en Belgique par DESCLEE &amp; Cie, ÉDTTEURS. S. A. Tournai.— 3295</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
